  "prompt": "How many customers ordered in 2024 and also ordered in 2025? Use the orders table. order_ts holds the time of the order in UTC, so take the years in UTC: 2024 runs from 2024-01-01 00:00 up to but not including 2025-01-01 00:00, and 2025 from 2025-01-01 00:00 up to but not including 2026-01-01 00:00. Leave out guest orders, whose customer_id is missing, and count each customer once. Return one column, customers, the number of customers, in one row. Any row order is fine.",
